# ── Lodgist Commit Message Template ──────────────────────────────────────
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored. An empty message aborts the commit.
#
# FORMAT:
#   <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# TYPES:
#   feat      New feature for the user, not a new feature for build script
#   fix       Bug fix for the user, not a fix to a build script
#   docs      Changes to the documentation
#   style     Formatting, missing semi colons, etc; no production code change
#   refactor  Refactoring production code, eg. renaming a variable
#   perf      Performance improvements
#   test      Adding missing tests, refactoring tests; no production code change
#   build     Changes that affect the build system or external dependencies
#   ci        Changes to CI configuration files and scripts
#   chore     Updating grunt tasks etc; no production code change
#
# SCOPES (Lodgist):
#   frontend      Next.js app-router frontend
#   backend       Express API, services, middleware
#   db            Prisma schema, migrations, seeds
#   infra         AWS CDK, App Runner, RDS, CI/CD
#   auth          NextAuth, WebAuthn, RBAC, session
#   payments      Paystack integration, escrow, webhooks
#   bookings      Booking flow, concierge, tenancy agreements
#   verification  Land registry, trust safety engine, fraud detection
#   listings      Listing CRUD, search, detail pages
#   docs          README, BETA_STATUS, AGENTS, plans
#   config        Env vars, tooling config, workspace settings
#   packages      Shared packages (ai-core, db, etc.)
#
# RULES:
#   • Subject:     ≤ 50 chars, imperative mood ("add" not "added"), no period
#   • Body:        wrap at 72 chars, explain WHAT and WHY (not HOW)
#   • Footer:      reference issues (Closes: #N), mark BREAKING CHANGE
#
# ── Example ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# feat(payments): add Paystack escrow verification endpoint
#
# Implements /api/payments/verify to confirm Paystack transaction
# references on booking confirmation. Validates HMAC signature,
# transitions escrow state to HELD, and triggers concierge SMS.
#
# BREAKING CHANGE: Existing bookings without paystack_reference will
#   require migration to populate the column.
# Closes: #189
#
# ── Your commit message starts below ──
